OL,3,GNEWSA'He's massive!' Meet Hugo, the
OL,4,Aworld's tallest horse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Shire horse that has entered the
OL,7,Frecord books as the world's tallest
OL,8,Fliving horse could exceed his height as
OL,9,Fhe is still growing, his owner has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FHugo who lives in Towcester,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, has already reached
OL,14,Fan "abnormal" 6ft 6.2in - just shy of
OL,15,Ftwo metres tall - or about 19.4 hands.
OL,17,FGuinness World Records said the
OL,18,Ffour-year-old's height was officially
OL,19,Fassessed by a vet and after he was
OL,20,Fmeasured without shoes, to "ensure an
OL,21,Faccurate result".
