OL,5,
OL,6,FBrett Masters says Hugo receives "a
OL,7,Fhuge amount of care" from a
OL,8,Fchiropractor, dentist, vet and
OL,9,Fmasseuse, meaning he lives a "five-star
OL,10,Flifestyle".
